them, but you can understand.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:47.723
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:47.723 --> 00:00:48.870
- And you know, going
backwards and healing

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.610
but also rebuilding something stronger

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:51.443
for the future.

00:00:51.443 --> 00:00:52.500
- [Kelly} You're very healthy.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.625
