00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:15.543
(laughing)

00:01:15.543 --> 00:01:16.376
- Yes, yes, exactly.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.092
- But, it's good though
that ya'll have that

00:01:18.092 --> 00:01:20.280
communicative, I wish
I would have had that.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.240
Like, my father passed away,

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:22.824
