00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:26.813
- [George] Right.

00:01:26.813 --> 00:01:28.290
- So, it's really remarkable and awesome.

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:29.850
- We be- we believe
you know the first show

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:31.350
