00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.232
Um, you know, I-I when I
was growing up was very

00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:43.200
tough and people would just
disappear from your lives.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.033
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:45.760
